- Organizing books into custom collections or shelves.
- Moving books between shelves.
- Renaming books.
- Changing cover styles.
- Duplicating a book as a new document.
- Archiving a book.
- Searching by title or document content.
- Sorting by title, type, creation date, or last edited.
- Opening recently edited books.
- Pinning favourite books.
